{"title": "Browbeaten", "pageid": 28320, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Browbeaten", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Browbeaten</b> is a passive feature that enhances defense against spells while threatened by a nearby enemy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer gains a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">spell save DC</a> while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\">Threatened</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Browbeaten\"> Condition: Browbeaten </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Browbeaten_(Condition)\" title=\"Browbeaten (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Browbeaten\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Browbeaten_(Condition)\" title=\"Browbeaten (Condition)\">Browbeaten</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a +1 bonus to spell save <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">DC</a> while threatened.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Browbeaten_Circlet\" title=\"Browbeaten Circlet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Browbeaten_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Browbeaten_Circlet\" title=\"Browbeaten Circlet\">Browbeaten Circlet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202009\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1442/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11827/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2715/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 817821/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.420      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   43.420      1 -total\n 30.62%   13.295      1 Template:Cond\n 24.01%   10.423      2 Template:Icon_link\n 23.13%   10.044      2 Template:Icon_text\n 22.75%    9.880      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 21.93%    9.523     11 Template:Trim\n 21.41%    9.298      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 18.04%    7.831      4 Template:Ifempty\n 17.76%    7.710      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28320-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202009 and revision id 392740. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}